<section class="phero"><img class="phero-bg" src="/assets/img/photos/estimate-desk.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/estimate-desk-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/estimate-desk.webp 1024w" sizes="100vw" width="1024" height="626" alt="" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><div class="wrap phero-in"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li aria-current="page">Services</li></ol></nav><p class="tag">What we do</p><h1>South Dakota Insurance Appraisal Services</h1><p class="lede">Twelve services, one goal: an accurate, defensible valuation of your loss. Start with an estimate review, or bring us in once appraisal has been demanded.</p><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn sun" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="i" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> Call (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn line-light" href="/get-a-claim-review/">Free claim review</a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="icards"><a class="icard rv" href="/appraiser-services/appraisal-clause-appraiser/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/consult-table.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consult-table-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consult-table.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 360px" width="1200" height="890" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 01</small><h2>Appraisal Clause Representation</h2><p>Named as your appraiser once you or the carrier demand appraisal under the policy.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraiser-services/homeowners-claim-appraiser/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/home-porch.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/home-porch-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/home-porch.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 360px" width="1200" height="674" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 02</small><h2>Homeowner Claim Appraisal</h2><p>Houses, townhomes and condo units where the carrier’s estimate leaves real repair costs out.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraiser-services/commercial-hoa-claim-appraiser/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/apartments.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/apartments-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/apartments.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 360px" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 03</small><h2>Commercial &amp; HOA Claim Appraisal</h2><p>Retail, office, multifamily, church, school and association properties with large, layered losses.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraiser-services/hail-roof-damage-appraiser/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hail-roof.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hail-roof-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hail-roof.webp 800w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 360px" width="800" height="531" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 04</small><h2>Roof &amp; Hail Damage Appraisal</h2><p>Shingle, metal, siding and gutter claims after South Dakota hail, from pea-size to record-size stones.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraiser-services/tornado-straight-line-wind-appraiser/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/tornado-damage.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/tornado-damage-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/tornado-damage.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 360px" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 05</small><h2>Wind, Tornado &amp; Derecho Appraisal</h2><p>Straight-line wind, derecho and tornado losses to roofs, siding, trees and structures.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraiser-services/water-damage-claim-appraiser/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/water-ceiling.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/water-ceiling-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/water-ceiling.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 360px" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 06</small><h2>Water Damage Claim Appraisal</h2><p>Burst pipes, appliance leaks, sewer backup endorsements and wind-driven rain inside the home.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraiser-services/fire-smoke-damage-appraiser/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/house-fire-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/house-fire.webp 800w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 360px" width="800" height="493" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 07</small><h2>Fire &amp; Smoke Claim Appraisal</h2><p>Structure fires, smoke and soot migration, and the contents inventory that follows.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraiser-services/black-hills-wildfire-claim-appraiser/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/wildfire.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/wildfire-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/wildfire.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 360px" width="1200" height="812" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 08</small><h2>Black Hills Wildfire Claim Appraisal</h2><p>Ember, smoke, ash and heat damage from fires in the Black Hills and western prairie.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraiser-services/blizzard-ice-snow-load-appraiser/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/snow-house.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/snow-house-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/snow-house.webp 683w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 360px" width="683" height="1024" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 09</small><h2>Blizzard, Ice &amp; Snow Load Appraisal</h2><p>Ice storms, ice dams, snow-load collapse and blizzard damage to roofs and structures.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraiser-services/farm-ranch-outbuilding-appraiser/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/farm-buildings.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/farm-buildings-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/farm-buildings.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 360px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 10</small><h2>Farm &amp; Ranch Building Appraisal</h2><p>Machine sheds, pole barns, shops, grain bins and livestock buildings on farm and ranch policies.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraiser-services/insurance-estimate-second-opinion/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/estimate-desk.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/estimate-desk-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/estimate-desk.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 360px" width="1024" height="626" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 11</small><h2>Insurance Estimate Review</h2><p>A line-by-line review of the carrier’s estimate before you decide on appraisal or a supplement.</p></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/appraiser-services/umpire-and-neutral-appraiser/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/meeting.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/meeting-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/meeting.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 360px" width="1200" height="795" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 12</small><h2>Umpire Services</h2><p>Neutral umpire work on appraisal panels where we represent neither side.</p></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap split">
<div class="rv"><p class="kicker">Not sure where to start?</p><h2>Most claims begin with an estimate review</h2><p>Before anyone demands appraisal, it helps to know exactly where the carrier’s estimate falls short and what that gap is worth. Many disputes close at that stage.</p><p>You won’t find a hurricane service here. Tropical storms don’t reach South Dakota, but derecho winds, blizzards, record hail and Black Hills wildfires do, and each has its own page.</p><a class="btn ink" href="/appraiser-services/insurance-estimate-second-opinion/">About estimate reviews <svg class="i" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div>
<div class="rv"><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I hire you for one part of the process?</summary><div class="ans"><p>Yes. Many clients start with an estimate review and decide later whether to demand appraisal.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you handle farm and commercial claims?</summary><div class="ans"><p>Yes: farmsteads, ranch buildings, apartments, retail, churches and HOA properties.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you only work on hail claims?</summary><div class="ans"><p>No. We handle wind, winter, water, fire, wildfire and other covered perils.</p></div></details></div></div>
</div></section>
<section class="strip"><div class="wrap strip-in rv"><div><h2>Not sure the carrier’s number is right?</h2><p>Send the estimate and your photos. We’ll review it and tell you what we see.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn ink" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="i" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn line" href="/get-a-claim-review/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
